(Introduction to Retrieval-Augmented Generation) Tj
T*
(These notes are the sample document for the RAG intro project.) Tj
T*
(The indexer splits this PDF into overlapping chunks, embeds each chunk) Tj
T*
(with OpenAI text-embedding-3-large, and stores the vectors in Qdrant.) Tj
T*
(The FastAPI query route retrieves the nearest chunks and asks an LLM) Tj
T*
(to answer only from that context, citing page numbers.) Tj
T*
(What is RAG?) Tj
T*
(Retrieval-Augmented Generation combines a search step with a language) Tj
T*
(model. Instead of asking the model to recall facts from training data,) Tj
T*
(the application first finds relevant passages from a private knowledge) Tj
T*
(base and then passes those passages to the model as context.) Tj
ET
endstream
