(The stack used in this project) Tj
T*
(Qdrant is the vector database. Docker Compose starts qdrant/qdrant) Tj
T*
(and publishes port 6333. This project uses collection sample_collection.) Tj
T*
(OpenAI embeddings and chat) Tj
T*
(Indexing uses text-embedding-3-large. Query answering uses a chat model) Tj
T*
(set by OPENAI_CHAT_MODEL. Both read OPENAI_API_KEY from the environment.) Tj
T*
(FastAPI query route) Tj
T*
(POST /query/ accepts a question. The handler runs similarity_search) Tj
T*
(against Qdrant and sends a system prompt plus the user question.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
