(How to run the demo) Tj
T*
(Start Qdrant with docker compose up -d.) Tj
T*
(Copy .env.example to .env and put in a valid OpenAI API key.) Tj
T*
(POST /index/ a PDF or run python index.py.) Tj
T*
(Start the API with python -m uvicorn main:app --reload.) Tj
T*
(Facts you can ask about) Tj
T*
(Qdrant listens on port 6333.) Tj
T*
(The embedding model is text-embedding-3-large.) Tj
T*
(Chunks are 1000 characters with 400 characters of overlap.) Tj
T*
(The collection name is sample_collection.) Tj
T*
(The query router prefix is /query.) Tj
ET
endstream
